   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hey, can you tell me what a novella is? Is it just a short novel?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.54,
   "block": "books.dlg30",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Pretty much. It's longer than a short story but shorter than a novel, often somewhere around a hundred pages.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Why would someone write one instead of a full novel?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "block": "books.dlg30",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Some stories just fit that size. A single idea or a tight situation can feel stretched in a longer book.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Are they good for someone who hasn't read in years?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "block": "books.dlg30",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "They're perfect for that. You get a full story arc, and you can finish one in a weekend, which feels great.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg30"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, sold. I'll",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "books.dlg30"
  },
  {
